out.push("\n\n### 7.3 基础 CSS 实现\n\n```css\n.product-card {\n  transition: transform 300ms ease;\n}\n\n.product-card:hover {\n  transform: translateY(-8px);\n}\n\n@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {\n  .product-card {\n    transition: none;\n  }\n\n  .product-card:hover {\n    transform: none;\n  }\n}\n```\n\n这里不仅禁用了 transition，还取消了不必要的位移效果。\n\n如果只禁用 transition，商品卡片仍然会瞬间向上移动 8px，只是不再具有过渡过程。\n\n### 7.4 更推荐的设计方式：默认静态，按需启用动画\n\n```css\n.product-card {\n  transform: none;\n}\n\n@media (prefers-reduced-motion: no-preference)\n  and (hover: hover) {\n\n  .product-card {\n    transition: transform 300ms ease;\n  }\n\n  .product-card:hover {\n    transform: translateY(-8px);\n  }\n}\n```\n\n这种方案类似 Progressive Enhancement（渐进增强）。\n\n");
