out.push("\n\n例如每隔 3 秒自动替换促销公告，并不意味着因为间隔小于 5 秒就一定符合要求。\n\n### 10.2 是否支持 prefers-reduced-motion 就够了？\n\n通常不够。\n\n用户可能没有开启系统减少运动设置，却仍然希望暂停首页轮播，以便阅读某一张 Banner 上的促销内容。\n\n因此两套机制承担不同职责：\n\n| 机制 | 作用 |\n|---|---|\n| `prefers-reduced-motion` | 根据用户偏好调整默认动画行为 |\n| Pause / Play 按钮 | 用户在当前页面主动控制自动播放 |\n| Hover / Focus 暂停 | 避免在用户阅读和操作组件时自动切换 |\n| Previous / Next | 允许用户主动访问其他内容 |\n\n对于自动轮播，还需要避免用户已经手动暂停后，仅因为鼠标离开轮播区域就自动恢复播放。\n\n### 10.3 实战：实现可控制的 Announcement Bar\n\n```html\n<div id=\"announcement-bar\">\n  <button id=\"rotation-toggle\" type=\"button\">\n    Start automatic rotation\n  </button>\n\n  <button\n    id=\"previous-announcement\"\n    type=\"button\"\n    aria-label=\"Previous announcement\"\n  >\n    ←\n  </button>\n\n  <p id=\"announcement-message\">\n    Free shipping on orders over $50.\n  </p>\n\n  <button\n    id=\"next-announcement\"\n    type=\"button\"\n    aria-label=\"Next announcement\"\n  >\n    →\n  </button>\n</div>\n```\n\nJavaScript：\n\n```javascript\nconst bar = document.querySelector('#announcement-bar');\nconst message = document.querySelector('#announcement-message');\nconst toggle = document.querySelector('#rotation-toggle');\n\nconst motionQuery = window.matchMedia(\n  '(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)'\n);\n\nconst announcements = [\n  'Free shipping on orders over $50.',\n  'Get 20% off your first order.',\n  'Discover our new collection.'\n];\n\nlet index = 0;\nlet timer = null;\n\nfunction showAnnouncement(nextIndex) {\n  index =\n    (nextIndex + announcements.length) %\n    announcements.length;\n\n  message.textContent = announcements[index];\n}\n\nfunction stopRotation() {\n  clearInterval(timer);\n  timer = null;\n\n  toggle.textContent = 'Start automatic rotation';\n\n  message.setAttribute('aria-live', 'polite');\n}\n\nfunction startRotation() {\n  clearInterval(timer);\n\n  // 自动切换期间不持续打断屏幕阅读器\n  message.setAttribute('aria-live', 'off');\n\n  timer = setInterval(() => {\n    showAnnouncement(index + 1);\n  }, 6000);\n\n  toggle.textContent = 'Stop automatic rotation';\n}\n\ntoggle.addEventListener('click', () => {\n  timer === null\n    ? startRotation()\n    : stopRotation();\n});\n\ndocument\n  .querySelector('#previous-announcement')\n  .addEventListener('click', () => {\n    stopRotation();\n    showAnnouncement(index - 1);\n  });\n\ndocument\n  .querySelector('#next-announcement')\n  .addEventListener('click', () => {\n    stopRotation();\n    showAnnouncement(index + 1);\n  });\n\nbar.addEventListener('focusin', stopRotation);\nbar.addEventListener('pointerenter', stopRotation);\n\nmotionQuery.addEventListener('change', event => {\n  if (event.matches) {\n    stopRotation();\n  }\n});\n\nif (!motionQuery.matches) {\n  startRotation();\n} else {\n  stopRotation();\n}\n```\n\n这个教学示例展示了自动播放控制、减少运动偏好、键盘访问与状态同步的基本思路。\n\n生产环境中，还应针对播放控制按钮自身的焦点事件与点击顺序进行处理，避免焦点触发自动暂停后，用户点击原本想按下的停止按钮却重新启动轮播。手动切换的播报也需要使用目标屏幕阅读器验证，必要时使用提前建立的独立 Live Region。\n\n对于完整的 Carousel 组件，我们会在第 18 课深入实现。\n\n---\n\n## 11. Marquee 无限滚动动画\n\n这种效果在跨境电商活动页中非常常见。\n\n");
